# Omadora core package list installed with dnf on Fedora.
# The ISO builder also reads this file when staging packages.
# Lines starting with # are notes and are ignored by installers.
#
# Repos needed beyond Fedora proper (enabled by install scripts):
#   terra                    - limine, mise, usage-cli, localsend-bin, uwsm,
#                              golang-github-jesseduffield-lazygit, asusctl,
#                              broadcom-wl
#   lionheartp/Hyprland COPR - hyprland, hyprpicker, hyprsunset,
#                              hyprland-guiutils, xdg-desktop-portal-hyprland,
#                              quickshell
#   RPM Fusion free/nonfree  - codecs, obs-studio, intel-media-driver,
#                              akmod-nvidia, libva-intel-driver
#   kammer/omadora            - Omadora runtime and ported Omarchy apps
#
# Arch name shown in (parens) where it differs.

